    "title": "European natural gas price — Dutch TTF front-month futures, monthly close in EUR/MWh",
    "description": "Monthly closing price of Dutch TTF natural gas front-month futures in EUR/MWh, Nov 2017 to May 2026. TTF is the benchmark wholesale gas price for continental Europe. The series spans the 2020 COVID demand collapse (low ~4 EUR/MWh), the 2021 supply crunch, the 2022 Russian-supply shock (peak ~240 EUR/MWh), and the subsequent normalization to the 28-50 range. Used by an energy-intensive EU industrial buyer (a German glass/ceramics manufacturer) to decide what share of next quarter's gas to lock in forward versus leave to spot. Source: Yahoo Finance TTF=F; a few missing months linearly interpolated to keep the series contiguous.",
